    "title": "Urbana Fall Fusion Festival set for Oct. 10",
    "text": "1 days ago The fourth annual Urbana Fall Fusion Festival will take place in downtown Urbana on Saturday, October 10, 2026, from 3–7 p.m. The event will feature family-friendly art, music, and community activities, with a fire performance and acrobatics planned for later in the evening. The festival is sponsored by the City of Urbana and the Urbana Arts & Culture Program , with programming by Kelly White .\nThis content is adapted from materials provided by Urbana Arts and Culture Program\nThis article includes content summarized and organized with AI tools, which can make mistakes. Learn more.",
